  - side: 0
    characterName: Jetty
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: bb4a40a34f961664591ec86a97fbdc10, type: 3}
    sentence: "Maybe I have, but it\u2019s always been in a professional setting,
      and never from someone as cute as you."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Lynn
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 62eaae04548671943969da195ad840fd, type: 3}
    sentence: Why does this kind of feels like a tactic to get me flustered?
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Jetty
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Oh I don\u2019t know where you got that impression from.. Is it working?"
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Lynn
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Yeah. It\u2019s working a bit too well."
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 0
    characterName: Jetty
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Good, I want to see what color you turn when you blush.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 1
    characterName: Lynn
    characterSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6dc6dc528b1ca174c8f9f2f96dd29415, type: 3}
    sentence: '*chuckles nervously* Fucking hell...'
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 2
    characterName: Counselor
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: Hate to interrupt, for a fun reason at least. I have a little game
      for the both of you to get to know each other better.
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 2
    characterName: Counselor
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "The tablet in front of you displays the Icebreaker. A game I\u2019m
      sure both of you are familiar with, being free, artsy spirits and all.\r\n"
    eventTrigger: 
    choices: []
  - side: 3
    characterName: Chaperon
    characterSprite: {fileID: 0}
    sentence: "Niceeee, you\u2019re getting good at this."
